#There are two Procedures that use the GPS imported road data. One is an example of city driving and is named "Follow Short GPS Path" (see GPS Short Road Import example).  The second Procedure dataset is "Follow Long GPS Path" (used in this example) which is an import of a section of highway.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

